OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns after bluetongue case
OL,4,Aidentified in Norfolk
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorfolk farmer James Runciman has
OL,7,Fcriticised the government for not
OL,8,Fproviding a pre-emptive vaccination
OL,9,Fprogramme. The government has said it
OL,10,Fhas been working pro-actively to make
OL,11,Fvaccine stocks available.
